      "id": "claim_2e22e65dc34f46d8ae7455a93efd2173",
      "statement": "The edge parser reads `x-wd-clearance` and `x-wd-class` into an `EdgeVerdict`: an accepted class is one of verified, crawler, script, or browser; unknown classes are dropped, clearance labels remain forward-compatible, and absent annotations produce `present: false` rather than a browser or healthy verdict.",
